			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4299040">
									

<p>My problem with this is that it has so many different formats introduced that it looks like an <em>hors d'oeuvres platter</em> of alternative formats and logs; it is jarring to read it and have it look like a showcase of different kinds of formatting taken from the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-style-resource">Style Resource page</a>. Pick one (or two, at the very least) and stick with it. The inconsistency is very apparent and it just makes the entire article a messy mish-mash of formats.</p>
<p>It's also very distracting to put your attributions in the article. It doesn't make any sense and it ruins whatever investment any reader would've had from reading the article up until that point.</p>

